<p id="S4.F5.3" class="ltx_p ltx_figure_panel ltx_align_center"><span id="S4.F5.3.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">(a)</span> Benchmark ablations (maj@8)</p></div><div class="ltx_flex_break"></div><div class="ltx_flex_cell ltx_flex_size_1"><object type="image/svg+xml" data="2602.20574v1/figure_ablation_indomain.svg" id="S4.F5.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_figure_panel ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:405/162;" width="405" height="162"></object></div><div class="ltx_flex_break"></div><div class="ltx_flex_cell ltx_flex_size_1">
