<section id="A1.SS2" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">A.2 </span>Auxiliary Loss Terms</h3>

<div id="A1.SS2.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.SS2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Section <a href="#S3.SS3" title="3.3 Training Objectives ‣ 3 GATES: Gated Asymmetric Trajectory Self-Distillation ‣ GATES: Self-Distillation under Privileged Context with Consensus Gating" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">3.3</span></a> formally introduces the primary loss terms used in the optimization process.
In addition to the two distillation loss terms, we experimented with two other terms that can optionally be applied to the total loss.</p>
</div>
<section id="A1.SS2.SSS0.Px1" class="ltx_paragraph">
<h5 class="ltx_title ltx_title_paragraph">Consensus-correctness reward</h5>

<div id="A1.SS2.SSS0.Px1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.SS2.SSS0.Px1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">When enabled, we include a REINFORCE-style objective using a binary pseudo-correctness label <math id="A1.SS2.SSS0.Px1.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="r_{i,j}\in\{0,1\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">r_{i,j}\in\{0,1\}</annotation></semantics></math> derived from tutor consensus, where <math id="A1.SS2.SSS0.Px1.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="r_{i,j}=1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">r_{i,j}=1</annotation></semantics></math> if rollout <math id="A1.SS2.SSS0.Px1.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="j" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>j</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">j</annotation></semantics></math>’s extracted answer matches the consensus for question <math id="A1.SS2.SSS0.Px1.p1.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="i" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>i</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">i</annotation></semantics></math>.
Applied on tutor rollouts under document context:</p>
<table id="A1.E5" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_table">
<tbody>
<tr id="A1.E5X" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E5X.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\mathcal{L}_{\text{cons}}(\theta)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℒ</mi><mtext>cons</mtext></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\mathcal{L}_{\text{cons}}(\theta)</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E5X.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=-\frac{1}{\sum_{i,j}g_{i}\,L^{(T)}_{i,j}}\sum_{i,j}g_{i}\,r_{i,j}\sum_{t=1}^{L^{(T)}_{i,j}}\tilde{\ell}^{(T)}_{i,j,t}(\theta)," display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo rspace="0em">=</mo><mo lspace="0em">−</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><msub><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub><mrow><msub><mi>g</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>L</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>T</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo></mstyle><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub><mi>g</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>i</mi></msub><mi>r</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo></mstyle><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><msup><mrow></mrow><msubsup><mi>L</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>T</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup></msup><mover accent="true"><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><msup><mrow></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>T</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msup><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>j</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mo>,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=-\frac{1}{\sum_{i,j}g_{i}\,L^{(T)}_{i,j}}\sum_{i,j}g_{i}\,r_{i,j}\sum_{t=1}^{L^{(T)}_{i,j}}\tilde{\ell}^{(T)}_{i,j,t}(\theta),</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="2" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equationgroup ltx_align_right">(5)</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A1.E5Xa" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E5Xa.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\qquad\tilde{\ell}^{(T)}_{i,j,t}(\theta)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>j</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>T</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\qquad\tilde{\ell}^{(T)}_{i,j,t}(\theta)</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E5Xa.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\coloneqq\log\pi_{\theta}\!\left(y^{(T)}_{i,j,t}\,\mid\,y^{(T)}_{i,j,&lt;t},d_{i},q_{i}\right)." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>≔</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><msub><mi>π</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><msubsup><mi>y</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>j</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>T</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo fence="true" lspace="0em" rspace="0.170em">∣</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>y</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>j</mi><mo>,</mo><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>T</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\coloneqq\log\pi_{\theta}\!\left(y^{(T)}_{i,j,t}\,\mid\,y^{(T)}_{i,j,&lt;t},d_{i},q_{i}\right).</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
</section>
<section id="A1.SS2.SSS0.Px2" class="ltx_paragraph">
<h5 class="ltx_title ltx_title_paragraph">KL regularization</h5>

<div id="A1.SS2.SSS0.Px2.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.SS2.SSS0.Px2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">We optionally regularize the student toward a frozen reference policy <math id="A1.SS2.SSS0.Px2.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\pi_{\text{ref}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>π</mi><mtext>ref</mtext></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\pi_{\text{ref}}</annotation></semantics></math>:</p>
<table id="A1.E6" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_table">
<tbody>
<tr id="A1.E6X" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E6X.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\mathcal{L}_{\text{KL}}(\theta)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℒ</mi><mtext>KL</mtext></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\mathcal{L}_{\text{KL}}(\theta)</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E6X.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\beta\,\frac{1}{\sum_{i,j}g_{i}\,L^{(S)}_{i,j}}\sum_{i,j}g_{i}\sum_{t=1}^{L^{(S)}_{i,j}}D_{i,j,t}(\theta)," display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi>β</mi><mo lspace="0.170em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><msub><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub><mrow><msub><mi>g</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>L</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>S</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munder><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow></munder></mstyle><mrow><msub><mi>g</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><msubsup><mi>L</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>S</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup></munderover></mstyle><mrow><msub><mi>D</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>j</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\beta\,\frac{1}{\sum_{i,j}g_{i}\,L^{(S)}_{i,j}}\sum_{i,j}g_{i}\sum_{t=1}^{L^{(S)}_{i,j}}D_{i,j,t}(\theta),</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="2" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equationgroup ltx_align_right">(6)</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A1.E6Xa" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E6Xa.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\qquad D_{i,j,t}(\theta)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>D</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>j</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\qquad D_{i,j,t}(\theta)</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E6Xa.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\coloneqq\mathrm{KL}\bigl(\pi_{\theta}(\cdot\mid y^{(S)}_{i,j,&lt;t},q_{i})\,\|\,\pi_{\text{ref}}(\cdot\mid y^{(S)}_{i,j,&lt;t},q_{i})\bigr)," display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo>≔</mo><mi>KL</mi><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">(</mo><mi>π</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>θ</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">⋅</mo><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.167em">∣</mo><mi>y</mi><msup><mrow></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>S</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msup><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>j</mi><mo>,</mo><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>q</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mo lspace="0.170em" rspace="0.337em">∥</mo><mi>π</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mtext>ref</mtext></msub><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">⋅</mo><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.167em">∣</mo><mi>y</mi><msup><mrow></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>S</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msup><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>j</mi><mo>,</mo><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>q</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">)</mo><mo>,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\coloneqq\mathrm{KL}\bigl(\pi_{\theta}(\cdot\mid y^{(S)}_{i,j,&lt;t},q_{i})\,\|\,\pi_{\text{ref}}(\cdot\mid y^{(S)}_{i,j,&lt;t},q_{i})\bigr),</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.SS2.SSS0.Px2.p1.2" class="ltx_p">where <math id="A1.SS2.SSS0.Px2.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\beta" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>β</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\beta</annotation></semantics></math> is a tunable coefficient.</p>
</div>
</section>
<section id="A1.SS2.SSS0.Px3" class="ltx_paragraph">
<h5 class="ltx_title ltx_title_paragraph">Total objective</h5>

<div id="A1.SS2.SSS0.Px3.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.SS2.SSS0.Px3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">The overall training objective is:</p>
</div>
<div id="A1.SS2.SSS0.Px3.p2" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<table id="A1.E7" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.E7.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{L}(\theta)=\lambda_{\text{off}}\,\mathcal{L}_{\text{off}}+\lambda_{\text{on}}\,\mathcal{L}_{\text{on}}+\lambda_{\text{cons}}\,\mathcal{L}_{\text{cons}}+\lambda_{\text{KL}}\,\mathcal{L}_{\text{KL}}" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℒ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>λ</mi><mtext>off</mtext></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℒ</mi><mtext>off</mtext></msub></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><msub><mi>λ</mi><mtext>on</mtext></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℒ</mi><mtext>on</mtext></msub></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><msub><mi>λ</mi><mtext>cons</mtext></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℒ</mi><mtext>cons</mtext></msub></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><msub><mi>λ</mi><mtext>KL</mtext></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℒ</mi><mtext>KL</mtext></msub></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{L}(\theta)=\lambda_{\text{off}}\,\mathcal{L}_{\text{off}}+\lambda_{\text{on}}\,\mathcal{L}_{\text{on}}+\lambda_{\text{cons}}\,\mathcal{L}_{\text{cons}}+\lambda_{\text{KL}}\,\mathcal{L}_{\text{KL}}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(7)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
<div id="A1.SS2.SSS0.Px3.p3" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.SS2.SSS0.Px3.p3.1" class="ltx_p">where <math id="A1.SS2.SSS0.Px3.p3.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{L}_{\text{cons}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℒ</mi><mtext>cons</mtext></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{L}_{\text{cons}}</annotation></semantics></math> is disabled by default.
The coefficients <math id="A1.SS2.SSS0.Px3.p3.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\lambda_{\cdot}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>λ</mi><mo>⋅</mo></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\lambda_{\cdot}</annotation></semantics></math> trade off dense trajectory-level learning (<math id="A1.SS2.SSS0.Px3.p3.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{L}_{\text{off}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℒ</mi><mtext>off</mtext></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{L}_{\text{off}}</annotation></semantics></math>, <math id="A1.SS2.SSS0.Px3.p3.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{L}_{\text{on}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℒ</mi><mtext>on</mtext></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{L}_{\text{on}}</annotation></semantics></math>) against the optional sparse correctness reward (<math id="A1.SS2.SSS0.Px3.p3.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{L}_{\text{cons}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℒ</mi><mtext>cons</mtext></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{L}_{\text{cons}}</annotation></semantics></math>) and stabilization (<math id="A1.SS2.SSS0.Px3.p3.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{L}_{\text{KL}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℒ</mi><mtext>KL</mtext></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{L}_{\text{KL}}</annotation></semantics></math>), while all terms remain gated by tutor consensus.
We find empirically that the consensus-correctness reward does not improve student transfer in our setting and can reduce student accuracy; consensus-gated trajectory distillation alone provides sufficient supervision (§<a href="#S4.SS3" title="4.3 Ablations ‣ 4 Empirical Evaluation ‣ GATES: Self-Distillation under Privileged Context with Consensus Gating" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">4.3</span></a>).</p>
</div>
</section>
</section>
<section id="A1.SS3" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">A.3 </span>Hyperparameters</h3>

<figure id="A1.T6" class="ltx_table">
<table id="A1.T6.2" class="ltx_tabular ltx_centering ltx_guessed_headers ltx_align_middle">
<tbody class="ltx_tbody">
<tr id="A1.T6.2.1" class="ltx_tr">
<th id="A1.T6.2.1.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_th ltx_th_row ltx_border_tt"><span id="A1.T6.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Hyperparameter</span></th>
<td id="A1.T6.2.1.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_tt"><span id="A1.T6.2.1.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Value</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A1.T6.2.2" class="ltx_tr">
<th id="A1.T6.2.2.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_th ltx_th_row ltx_border_t">Batch size (<math id="A1.T6.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="n" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>n</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">n</annotation></semantics></math> questions/step)</th>
<td id="A1.T6.2.2.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_t">32</td></tr>
<tr id="A1.T6.2.3" class="ltx_tr">
<th id="A1.T6.2.3.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_th ltx_th_row">Tutor rollouts per question (<math id="A1.T6.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="k" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>k</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">k</annotation></semantics></math>)</th>
<td id="A1.T6.2.3.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">8</td></tr>
<tr id="A1.T6.2.4" class="ltx_tr">
<th id="A1.T6.2.4.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_th ltx_th_row">Student rollouts per question (<math id="A1.T6.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="k" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>k</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">k</annotation></semantics></math>)</th>
<td id="A1.T6.2.4.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">8</td></tr>
<tr id="A1.T6.2.5" class="ltx_tr">
<th id="A1.T6.2.5.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_th ltx_th_row">Training temperature (tutor/student)</th>
<td id="A1.T6.2.5.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">0.5</td></tr>
<tr id="A1.T6.2.6" class="ltx_tr">
<th id="A1.T6.2.6.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_th ltx_th_row">Training top-<math id="A1.T6.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="p" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>p</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">p</annotation></semantics></math> (tutor/student)</th>
<td id="A1.T6.2.6.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">1.0</td></tr>
<tr id="A1.T6.2.7" class="ltx_tr">
<th id="A1.T6.2.7.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_th ltx_th_row">Training top-<math id="A1.T6.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="k" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>k</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">k</annotation></semantics></math> (tutor/student)</th>
<td id="A1.T6.2.7.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left"><math id="A1.T6.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="-1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">-1</annotation></semantics></math></td></tr>
<tr id="A1.T6.2.8" class="ltx_tr">
<th id="A1.T6.2.8.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_th ltx_th_row">Max completion tokens (train rollouts)</th>
<td id="A1.T6.2.8.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">512</td></tr>
<tr id="A1.T6.2.9" class="ltx_tr">
<th id="A1.T6.2.9.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_th ltx_th_row">Consensus gate (tutor agreement)</th>
<td id="A1.T6.2.9.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left"><math id="A1.T6.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\geq 4/8" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>≥</mo><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>/</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\geq 4/8</annotation></semantics></math></td></tr>
<tr id="A1.T6.2.10" class="ltx_tr">
<th id="A1.T6.2.10.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_th ltx_th_row">Consensus criterion</th>
<td id="A1.T6.2.10.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">Extracted final-answer equivalence</td></tr>
<tr id="A1.T6.2.11" class="ltx_tr">
<th id="A1.T6.2.11.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_th ltx_th_row">Consensus action</th>
<td id="A1.T6.2.11.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">Skip question (zero loss) if below threshold</td></tr>
<tr id="A1.T6.2.12" class="ltx_tr">
<th id="A1.T6.2.12.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_th ltx_th_row">Advantage clip (<math id="A1.T6.m8" class="ltx_Math" alttext="a" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>a</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">a</annotation></semantics></math>)</th>
<td id="A1.T6.2.12.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left"><math id="A1.T6.m9" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\pm 5" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo>±</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\pm 5</annotation></semantics></math></td></tr>
<tr id="A1.T6.2.13" class="ltx_tr">
<th id="A1.T6.2.13.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_th ltx_th_row">Off-policy distillation weight (<math id="A1.T6.m10" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\lambda_{\text{off}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>λ</mi><mtext>off</mtext></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\lambda_{\text{off}}</annotation></semantics></math>)</th>
<td id="A1.T6.2.13.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">1.0</td></tr>
<tr id="A1.T6.2.14" class="ltx_tr">
<th id="A1.T6.2.14.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_th ltx_th_row">On-policy distillation weight (<math id="A1.T6.m11" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\lambda_{\text{on}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>λ</mi><mtext>on</mtext></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\lambda_{\text{on}}</annotation></semantics></math>)</th>
<td id="A1.T6.2.14.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">0.1</td></tr>
<tr id="A1.T6.2.15" class="ltx_tr">
<th id="A1.T6.2.15.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_th ltx_th_row">Consensus reward weight (<math id="A1.T6.m12" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\lambda_{\text{cons}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>λ</mi><mtext>cons</mtext></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\lambda_{\text{cons}}</annotation></semantics></math>)</th>
<td id="A1.T6.2.15.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">0 or tuned per ablation</td></tr>
<tr id="A1.T6.2.16" class="ltx_tr">
<th id="A1.T6.2.16.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_th ltx_th_row">KL-to-reference weight (<math id="A1.T6.m13" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\lambda_{\text{KL}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>λ</mi><mtext>KL</mtext></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\lambda_{\text{KL}}</annotation></semantics></math>)</th>
<td id="A1.T6.2.16.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">.02</td></tr>
<tr id="A1.T6.2.17" class="ltx_tr">
<th id="A1.T6.2.17.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_th ltx_th_row">Optimizer</th>
<td id="A1.T6.2.17.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">AdamW</td></tr>
<tr id="A1.T6.2.18" class="ltx_tr">
<th id="A1.T6.2.18.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_th ltx_th_row">Learning rate</th>
<td id="A1.T6.2.18.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left"><math id="A1.T6.m14" class="ltx_Math" alttext="1\times 10^{-6}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">1\times 10^{-6}</annotation></semantics></math></td></tr>
<tr id="A1.T6.2.19" class="ltx_tr">
<th id="A1.T6.2.19.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_th ltx_th_row">Weight decay</th>
<td id="A1.T6.2.19.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">0.01</td></tr>
<tr id="A1.T6.2.20" class="ltx_tr">
<th id="A1.T6.2.20.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_th ltx_th_row ltx_border_bb">Gradient clipping</th>
<td id="A1.T6.2.20.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_bb">1.0</td></tr>
</tbody>
</table>
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 6: </span>Training hyperparameters used unless otherwise specified.</figcaption>
</figure>
